WEBVTT

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.990
Damn, I'm tired.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.490
School takes so much out of me.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.250
I can't keep this up anymore.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.640
Onii-chan?

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:51.990
Let's see what kind of porn DVDs he's been watching.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:54.030
I can't believe he's interested in other girls.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.830
That's like cheating on me!

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.370
He's young, so I understand his libido can get out of control,

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:00.710
but he's dead if this isn't guys screwing their sisters!

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:12.800
I'm the one in charge of this project, Yagami Tsurugi.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.600
Without further ado, let's begin the Sasami Watch Project.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:18.980
Huh?

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:56.610
Testing, testing. One, two, three.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.910
Do I look good on video, Tsukuyomi?

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:00.660
Yes, you look just fine.

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.040
What is this?

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.210
The goal of the Sasami Watch Project is

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:09.540
to support Tsukuyomi Sasami,
who has finally managed to rejoin society.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.670
Support me?

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:16.630
Despite the power of the supreme god inside her,
she's trying to live an ordinary life.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:21.140
If that's how she wants to live,
I want to help her in every way I can.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.680
That's what we're here for.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:25.560
Tsurugi...

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:29.560
To that end, we'll train Sasami how to deal with real life by giving her challenges to overcome.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:31.320
The members of the Sasami Watch Project will

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:37.660
videotape this clueless girl and laugh at her when she struggles and screws up.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.160
I should've known they were up to no good.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.160
Sasami has already been
assigned a challenging task,

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:46.870
and my capable little sisters are filming her.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.630
Hey, Camera Two, give us an update.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.170
That's too close! Get away from the camera!

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:57.720
This is Yagami Kagami with Camera Two.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:02.430
I'm currently tailing Sasami-san at a distance of 30 meters.

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.770
Isn't that... me?

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:08.270
Sasami-san does not seem
to have noticed I'm following her.

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:10.360
When did they film this?

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.770
Did I ever go somewhere like that?

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.230
I don't remember being there.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.280
What's going on?

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:17.110
Good work, Kagami.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:19.780
Next up, Camera Three.
How are things over there?

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:24.160
Oh, yeah. I became a presenter for our school's TV broadcasts!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.200
But guess what?

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:30.670
I spoke too loudly on air,
so the headmaster, who has a weak heart—

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:31.670
A phone call!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.000
Hello, Tama speaking!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.630
Where are you right now?

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.220
Well, there was a bright flash from the sky,

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.930
then I found myself here.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:45.890
Then these little gray people with big eyes, who are filming me right now, said to me,

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:51.100
"Intelligent Earth lifeform,
we have questions for you,"

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.230
in a really unnatural accent.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.650
Don't trust strangers!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:00.860
They might perform operations on you while you're still
conscious or plant mysterious pieces of metal inside you!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.320
Anyway, get back to work!

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.790
Uh, Tsurugi-sensei, what was that just now?

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:07.870
Don't talk about it.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.410
Pretend you never saw it!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:12.210
Hey, Camera Two, I want another update.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.170
What the hell are you doing?!

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:17.130
Nee-san, can we take it home with us?

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:19.170
Now's not the time for that. Where's Sasami?

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.180
Well...

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:22.640
I think I lost her.

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:23.430
Are you kidding me?!

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:28.930
I will use something akin to a spiritual wave from
a satellite in orbit to detect Sasami-san's location.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.350
I know her location.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.690
She seems to be at the other side
of the shopping mall.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:38.320
H-Hey...

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.540
Don't dash on the rooftops!
What are you, a ninja?!

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:56.670
Tee-hee.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.500
Don't "Tee-hee" me!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.420
You're adorable!

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.920
Please marry me!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.840
Sasami-san seems to be entering a drugstore.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.760
Good, good.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.060
She's on her way to buy what I asked her to get.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:13.350
Oh? Sasami-san appears to be having trouble locating the item she's after.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.480
Nee-san, what did you ask her to get?

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.020
Are you looking for something?

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.030
Um, this...

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:22.320
One box of prophylactics? Okay.

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.080
That's not something
a minor should be buying!

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:32.160
A cute high school girl,
blushing, asks for prophylactics.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.410
Isn't that just adorable?

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:37.130
Sorry, but it seems we don't carry that here.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.550
I see.

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:41.670
My teacher told me it'd be
at the drugstore, though.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.930
By the way, what's a prophylactic?

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.590
Huh? <i>You</i> don't know what that is?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:52.310
The sad truth is that young people these days don't use that term.

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:55.350
I'd say your attempt to
sexually harass her failed.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.400
No way!

00:06:56.400 --> 00:07:00.480
People used to laugh out loud
at the mention of "prophylactics"!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.740
It seems Sasami-san is off to buy the next item on her list.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.910
Oh, she entered a 100-yen store.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.000
What would she go there for?

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.120
You didn't tell her to buy something from there?

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:15.830
Nope.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.330
Oh, she came out.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.590
It looks like she bought something.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:20.750
Let me see what's inside the bag.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.380
You can see through objects?!

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.050
Sunglasses and a knit hat.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:28.140
I also see a sweatsuit.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.640
Who cares about that? Use that power on Sasami!

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:31.850
What color are they?

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.270
What are you trying to see?!

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:36.310
I don't care what color Sasami-san's panties are.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.270
That'd be nice to know,
but I'm talking about her nipples!

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.690
Stop it!

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:40.270
Oh?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.900
What's wrong? She's not
wearing any panties?!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:46.240
She is about to enter a bath complex.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:48.030
I wonder why.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.700
Couldn't she just take a bath at home?

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:54.410
She might not want to because Tsukuyomi peeps on her.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.410
I never peep.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.080
We always enter the bathroom together.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:00.420
You do what?!

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:01.880
She went inside.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.130
I'll follow her.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.800
One high school student.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:12.680
I'm amazed they just let you in with that camera in your hand.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:17.350
I had their perception undergo
a Transformation so that it wouldn't bother them.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.810
That's my little sister!

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.810
