00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.110
Stop!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:26.190
Stop filming!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:27.610
I'm getting undressed!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.280
Stop it!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.740
No!

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.450
Okay, time for a commercial break!

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:40.000
It was a tranquil winter night, bathed in dazzling moonlight.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.510
When did they...

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:52.430
No, that's not what it looks like!

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.810
Ah, jeez.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.710
The hell is this footage?

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:30.590
Part of my treasured
Sasami-san's Sleeping Face collection!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:34.800
You're supposed to say,
"Smile! You're on Candid Camera!"

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.470
Enough of that, back to Camera Two.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.270
Kagami? What are you doing, Kagami?

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:43.810
Please leave me alone.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.730
Why are you relaxing here?

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:47.360
What happened to the footage of Sasami getting in the bath?

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.910
If you're looking for Sasami-san,

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:56.200
