00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.700
I'm sleepy now.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:02.330
I regret to say this is as far as I go.

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.830
Hurry up and go after her!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.670
Aren't you supposed to be in my debt?

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:09.760
As your big sister, changing your diapers and offering you a pacifier are things

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:14.010
I'd love to do as part of some ageplay, because I adore you so much!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:17.640
I don't get what you're talking about, you sexual deviant.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.180
Say it again!

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:23.730
Oh well. Tsukuyomi, we should take this into our own hands.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:28.360
What's with this DVD?

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:31.690
I don't remember ever running this errand.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.320
What's going on? I have a bad feeling about this.

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:36.240
This is bad.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:37.620
Really bad.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:38.740
Really bad!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.120
All right, we're here!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.330
Sasami is sure to come here!

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.710
Where are we?

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:48.040
This place is called Uzume no Ana.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.340
With a focus on anime, game, and manga items,

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:54.050
