relevant to modern subcultures.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:55.800
Think of it as a kind of department store.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.970
So basically a shop for otaku.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.180
You put it so bluntly.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:00.930
So, where's Sasami-san?

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:02.930
On the third floor.

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:03.520
Let's go!

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:08.610
It says those under 18 are not allowed on the third floor.

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:11.990
Where's Sasami?

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:12.740
Found her!

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:16.490
She's in disguise, but it doesn't fool me!

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:17.910
