00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:21.580
Let's check.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:25.080
Ibuki-chan from <i>Yamato Chronicles Taketake-run</i>?

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:29.040
"Buy the limited edition with detachable armor."

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.210
"The armor can't be taken off the standard model."

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.340
Who gives a shit?

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:40.050
This costs 30,000 yen?!

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.640
Anyway, I'll have to get the store clerk.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.280
Oh, she gave up.

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:12.250
Way to go, Sasami!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.880
Welcome to my world.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.380
I will give half of the world to you.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.510
Stop! Don't go over there!

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.550
Little sister fetish?

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:28.060
Why am I being humiliated like this?

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:30.560
No way.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.320
She's his little sister, right?

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.400
Why?

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:36.150
Oh, yeah. I can relate to that.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:36.780
What?

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:38.700
What are they doing?

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.450
This is a man's...

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.080
Kill me! Just kill me now!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:47.080
Um, do you have a moment?

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:48.710
You look like a high school student.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:50.960
Well, I'm...

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.920
Are you here for the VA's performance on the fourth floor?

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:55.670
Huh? Y-Yes.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.220
Sorry. I know it's hard to find your way around here.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.930
The staircase is over here.

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:01.840
Let's follow them, Tsurugi-sensei!

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.560
Shut it, fuckwit!

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.850
I told you, I ain't no grade-schooler!

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:06.850
Huh?

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.690
Just sell it to me!

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:13.020
I'm sorry little girl, I can only sell manga like these to adults.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:15.860
I told you already, I <i>am</i> an adult!

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.780
I'll just go on ahead.

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:27.200
Thanks, everybody!

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:36.750
What are you doing?

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.050
Get in sync with everybody else!

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:39.340
Huh? O-Okay.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:41.220
Wrong!

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.550
We're using red for this song!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:43.720
Huh? O-Okay.

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:05.330
Excuse me. Please let me through.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.450
Excuse me, sir!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.080
Video recording is prohibited.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:13.170
Oh? U-Um, no. I'm not filming the VA, I'm videotaping Sasami-san.

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.000
K-Kamiomi-san?!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.170
Why are you here?

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:21.090
Huh? Weren't you a shrine maiden at the Tsukuyomi Shrine?

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:25.050
I-I wasn't! I don't even know what Tsukuyomi Shrine is!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:27.310
Please leave, Kamiomi-san!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.770
If someone from the Tsukuyomi Shrine is here...

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:33.560
