00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.640
Congratulations are in order.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.390
Father!

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:09.640
My dear daughter!

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:11.850
Leave the excess burden to your father!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.020
Sasami-san!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:21.070
Now the Sun will surrender its throne to the Moon,

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:23.950
and the human world will see a new reader!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:35.580
What have you done, Father?!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.630
This soul planned it all.

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:41.840
When the seal weakened and it regained its self-consciousness,

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:46.510
it made contact with us
and suggested we execute this plan.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:47.760
Does that mean...

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:48.760
Indeed!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:51.760
The power of the supreme god is right here!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.640
Right in the palm of my hand!

00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:59.400
Screw that guy. He wasted my time over nothing.

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:00.020
Huh?

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.150
What are you doing, Tsukuyomi?

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:04.030
Do as you wish.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:13.290
So you were the source of the suspicious presence I sensed.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:19.040
You'll pay a heavy price
for interrupting my Happy Nap time.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.250
Out of my way!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:50.990
Sorry!

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:53.700
The government was after us, so I ran away here.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:57.540
Don't worry. I'll protect you.

00:16:57.540 --> 00:17:01.290
I won't hand over this marvel of the universe, Ntosmordent, to anyone!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.390
Hey, you over there!

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:21.060
Hand that alien over to the United Earth Government!

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.820
This little one will be going back to his home planet!

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:25.070
Now we've got no choice.

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.570
Commence the attack!

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.240
What the hell?! What's going on?

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:36.080
This seems to be a drug for erasing memories.

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:41.960
Boys, get rid of those mischievous meddlers!

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.250
All units, charge!

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.840
Let's run away, Kyupi-chan!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:57.600
I'll… be… free!

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.070
So that's what happened.

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:09.070
Huh?

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:13.870
I took down the grunts from the Tsukuyomi Shrine,

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:18.080
while Tsukuyomi called an ambulance and took Sasami to the hospital.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:27.000
You inhaled that green gas and
were disorientated by the memory loss.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:31.340
So I used Transformation to make a DVD that would give you the gist of what happened.

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:35.090
Do you remember who you are now...

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.600
Sarcoma-chan?

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:41.680
You were part of her body to begin with,

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:45.360
so it's no surprise you came home believing you're the real Sasami.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:49.860
What are you going to do with me?

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.610
You're a part of Sasami.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.490
I can't say what'll happen
when you're detached from her.

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.620
I'll use Transformation to change you back to a lump of flesh

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:01.540
then reattach it to Sasami so you can be reincorporated.

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:02.870
Then things will be back as they were.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.870
Don't mess with me!

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:07.210
I'll be free!

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.590
She and I are different people!

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:14.880
Do you understand the pain of being trapped in someone else's body, unable to do anything?

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.640
I was finally torn off from her.

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:18.510
I'll live freely, any way I want!

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:23.020
That's right, I have power.

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:26.100
The power of the supreme god is within me.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:29.770
I can do whatever I want to you!

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:33.490
I order in the name of the supreme god, you—

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:34.110
Give it back.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.370
You can't handle this toy.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:39.120
What...

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:43.910
I would've been nicer if you showed
some remorse and played along nicely.

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:51.800
Well, don't worry.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:54.170
I <i>do</i> feel a little sorry for you.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:56.930
I won't go so far as to say I'm a hard-working god,

00:19:57.390 --> 00:19:59.680
but I still make miracles happen once in a while!

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:11.520
Are you awake?

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.610
What happened to me?

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.860
You are who you always have been.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.700
Sarcoma's gone, though.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:22.620
Oh.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:26.960
She and you share the same body. You two are the same person.

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:30.040
You two had the same wish: to live freely.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.880
And both of you make a lot of trouble for those around you.

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:37.970
But she committed a sin.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:42.010
She attempted to sacrifice others for the sake of her own happiness.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:45.020
You, on the other hand, are well aware of the trouble you cause others

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:47.140
and do what you can to try and minimize it.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.610
You never abused the power of the supreme god.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.980
In fact, you're rejecting it,
saying you don't want it.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:58.700
So being the mischievous god I am,
I'll leave it with you.

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:02.330
Keep working hard

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:04.790
until the day you'll no longer have to.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:24.140
Hello, Meat-chan! It's your big sister, Kagami.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:26.310
Meat-chan?

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:28.140
That's the name I gave her.

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:33.860
I can't call her Sasami-san
just because she was a part of her, can I?

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:36.190
Meat is something you eat, though.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.700
She's so cute that I want to gobble her up,

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:42.450
although since I'm not human, I don't eat food.

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:43.160
Right.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.660
So where's Tama?

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:55.920
Goodbye!

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:06.180
There are some scientific fields
humans aren't ready to explore yet.

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:11.940
What's up?

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:15.520
I'm your much-loved protagonist, Tsukuyomi Sasami!

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:17.980
I'll be singing a song for you all today!

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:18.990
So listen up, okay?

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:21.280
Tsukuyomi Sasami's "Osmotic Pressure Symphony!"

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:21.780
What?

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:50.770
Are you really Sasami-san?

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:52.190
Who are you?

00:22:52.190 --> 00:22:55.360
Come on, I've always been like this, Onii-chan!

00:22:55.360 --> 00:22:57.020
I love you! Kiss, kiss!

00:22:57.820 --> 00:23:00.320
This feels so strange.

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:15.580
I'm doing pretty well, I think.

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:17.250
Did I manage to sing well?

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:18.920
Well, um… yes!

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:21.300
The singing itself was perfect.

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.420
Then I'll sing next time too!

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:27.100
I was driven out of the main episode, but there's still a place for me here!

00:23:27.100 --> 00:23:29.100
I'll be happy here!

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:31.930
Okay, I'll sing even better next time!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:34.770
You're definitely not Sasami-san!

00:23:34.770 --> 00:23:36.560
Who are you?

00:23:41.860 --> 00:23:44.570
It's time for Lazy Counseling.

00:23:44.570 --> 00:23:47.620
We have a letter from Mr. A from Tokyo.

00:23:47.620 --> 00:23:49.910
"Lately, I haven't been motivated to do anything."

00:23:49.910 --> 00:23:52.250
"I feel like I've just been lazying around."

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:56.080
"I could do a good job if I tried, but I can't bring myself to."

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:58.630
"I think the world is to blame."

00:23:58.630 --> 00:24:01.380
"You understand how I feel, don't you, Sasami-san?"

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:03.380
Grow up. Get to work.

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:07.510
Next time, episode five:
"I Haven't Given It My All Yet."
